id=\"ccx-breaking\"> This is a breaking change (bumps MAJOR)</label>\n<div id=\"ccx-breakwrap\" hidden>\n<label class=\"ccx-lbl\" for=\"ccx-breakdesc\">What breaks &amp; how to migrate (goes in the footer)</label>\n<textarea id=\"ccx-breakdesc\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n</div>\n<div>\n<label class=\"ccx-lbl\" for=\"ccx-body\">Body (optional - the &quot;why&quot;)</label>\n<textarea id=\"ccx-body\" placeholder=\"explain the reasoning, trade-offs, or context behind the change\"></textarea>\n</div>\n<div>\n<label class=\"ccx-lbl\" for=\"ccx-issue\">Issue reference (optional)</label>\n<input type=\"text\" id=\"ccx-issue\" placeholder=\"Closes #42\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"ccx-btnrow\">\n<button class=\"ccx-btn ccx-ghost\" id=\"ccx-reset\">Reset</button>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"ccx-card\">\n<div class=\"ccx-sec\"><span class=\"ccx-sdot\"></span><h2>COMMIT MESSAGE</h2><span class=\"ccx-line\"></span><span class=\"ccx-badge\" id=\"ccx-outbadge\">feat</span></div>\n<div class=\"ccx-outwrap\">\n<textarea id=\"ccx-out\" readonly aria-label=\"Generated commit message\"></textarea>\n</div>\n<p class=\"ccx-meta\" id=\"ccx-outmeta\"></p>\n<p class=\"ccx-hint\" id=\"ccx-hint\"></p>\n<div class=\"ccx-sec\"><span class=\"ccx-sdot\"></span><h2>PR / MERGE TITLE</h2><span class=\"ccx-line\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"ccx-outwrap\">\n<textarea id=\"ccx-outtitle\" readonly aria-label=\"Generated PR title\"></textarea>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ccx-btnrow\">\n<button class=\"ccx-btn ccx-primary\" id=\"ccx-copy\">Copy commit</button>\n<button class=\"ccx-btn ccx-ghost\" id=\"ccx-titlecopy\">Copy PR title</button>\n<button class=\"ccx-btn ccx-ghost\" id=\"ccx-dl\">Download .txt</button>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"ccx-foot\">no server · conventional commits 1.0.0 · feat → MINOR, fix → PATCH, BREAKING CHANGE → MAJOR · nothing is uploaded</footer>\n</div>\n<!-- ═══ 4. related tools (6-point law #3) ═══ -->\n<section class=\"ccx-related\" aria-labelledby=\"ccx-related-h\">\n<h2 id=\"ccx-related-h\" class=\"ccx-related-h\">&gt;_ Related tools</h2>\n<div class=\"ccx-related-grid\">\n<a class=\"ccx-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/json-formatter/\">\n<span class=\"ccx-rel-name\">JSON Formatter</span>\n<span class=\"ccx-rel-desc\">Inspect the config and payload files your commit touches.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"ccx-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/debug-log-analyzer/\">\n<span class=\"ccx-rel-name\">Debug Log Analyzer</span>\n<span class=\"ccx-rel-desc\">Find what actually failed before you write the fix() message.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"ccx-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/htaccess-nginx-converter/\">\n<span class=\"ccx-rel-name\">.htaccess → Nginx Converter</span>\n<span class=\"ccx-rel-desc\">For chore(ci) and build commits - convert the server rules.</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"ccx-rel-card\" href=\"%BASE%/tools/sqlite-mysql-converter/\">\n<span class=\"ccx-rel-name\">SQLite ⇄ MySQL Converter</span>\n<span class=\"ccx-rel-desc\">Schema migrations deserve their own refactor() commit.</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- ═══ 5. visible FAQ (6-point law #2 - mirrors the FAQPage schema byte-exact) ═══ -->\n<section class=\"ccx-faq\" aria-labelledby=\"ccx-faq-h\">\n<h2 id=\"ccx-faq-h\" class=\"ccx-faq-h\">&gt;_ FAQ</h2>\n<details class=\"ccx-faq-item\">\n<summary>What does each conventional commit type mean?</summary>\n<p>feat = a new feature (bumps MINOR); fix = a bug fix (bumps PATCH); docs/style/refactor/perf/test/chore/ci/build cover documentation, formatting, non-functional change, performance, tests, and tooling respectively. A BREAKING CHANGE footer or a `!` after the type bumps MAJOR.</p>\n</details>\n<details class=\"ccx-faq-item\">\n<summary>How long should a conventional commit subject line be?</summary>\n<p>Keep the subject line to 50 characters or fewer - put detail in the body. The helper warns you if the subject grows past 50 characters.</p>\n</details>\n<details class=\"ccx-faq-item\">\n<summary>Is my commit message sent anywhere?</summary>\n<p>No - the generator runs entirely in your browser. Nothing is uploaded, logged, or stored; close the tab and it is gone.</p>\n</details>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--in-content\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-incontent-336x280-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"336\" height=\"280\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"tablet\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-incontent-336x280-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"336\" height=\"280\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"mobile\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-incontent-300x250-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"250\"></div></template>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--before-footer\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-